    <string name="privacy_body">No ads, no tracking, no account. Group links stay only on this phone and are excluded from backups. The app uses the network only when you open or refresh a screen: no background sync. For currency conversion it only sends currency codes (e.g. VND, EUR) to the European Central Bank service Frankfurter, like the Spliit website, or to currency-api as a fallback; rates are saved for offline use.</string>
